# Teo, Spirited Glider, 1/4 flying: "Whenever one or more creatures you control with flying attack, draw a card, then discard a card. When you discard a
# nonland card this way, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control." Turn 3 Bot1 attacks with Teo and Ornithopter (two fliers) and Memnite (a
# non-flier): one trigger for the batch, so one card drawn (Island on top, after the Lightning Bolt it drew for the turn). Hand: Bolt and Island. Bolt
# is discarded, a nonland card, so the counter's target is chosen: Bot2's Phyrexian Walker (an opponent's creature) is refused, Bot1's Ornithopter is
# taken and becomes 1/3 (from 0/2), Teo and Memnite staying as they were. Library 13 -> 12 (turn draw) -> 11, exactly one more card.

